<title>UK: World Bank sets NZ$100 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets NZ$100 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    07.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.795   PAY DATE    07.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
